      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">All volumes were converted to energy using a BTU conversion factor of 1.03.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
