          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;">The Muldon Storage field has a certified maximum daily delivery capacity of 750,000 Mcf. (Dekatherm equivalent 772,500 by a factor of 1.030).</xhtml:span>
